		(descr "Landing pads for the BioMapping flex tail: 8 pads, 1.5 mm pitch. The tail's solder end lies flat on them and is soldered through its plated holes. Each pad runs 1.0 mm past the tail's tip, so the iron heats both pads at once and the solder forms a visible fillet there. The two silk lines mark the tail's sides and end where its tip lies; y < 0 is the board edge side.")
